# Dropping the booster in a two-stage rocket: only the booster fades, the sustainer stays solid, and mass/CG/CP/lanes follow
# the remaining stack.
#   BOWSHOCK_EXAMPLE=two_stage cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/stagetoggle.drive out/stagetoggle
viewport 1280x800
screenshot stagetoggle-full.png
click "Stage 2"
screenshot stagetoggle-stage2.png
click "Full stack"
screenshot stagetoggle-back.png

# Light theme, booster dropped.
click (936, 20)
click "Stage 2"
screenshot stagetoggle-stage2-light.png
